<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Full &amp; Final Settlement Statement</title>
    <style>
        @page { margin: 10mm 14mm 18mm 14mm; }
        html, body {
            margin: 0; padding: 0;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            color: #111111;
            font-size: 10px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }
        .header-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-bottom: 3px solid #f27022;
            padding-bottom: 8px;
            margin-bottom: 14px;
        }
        .logo { width: 158px; height: auto; }
        .logo-fallback { font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #f27022; letter-spacing: 0.5px; }
        .company-name { font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; color: #000000; letter-spacing: 0.5px; }
        .header-right { text-align: right; vertical-align: middle; font-size: 8.5px; color: #444444; line-height: 1.55; }
        .header-right .meta { font-size: 9.5px; color: #111111; }
        .title-block { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 14px; }
        .title-block h1 { font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #000000; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2.5px; margin: 0; }
        .title-block .sub { font-size: 10px; color: #555555; margin-top: 4px; }
        .st-draft { color: #6b7280; font-weight: bold; }
        .st-approved { color: #1d4ed8; font-weight: bold; }
        .st-disbursed { color: #047857; font-weight: bold; }
        .st-settled { color: #065f46; font-weight: bold; }
        .section-title {
            font-size: 10px; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1.2px;
            color: #f27022; border-left: 4px solid #f27022; padding-left: 8px; margin: 14px 0 7px 0;
        }
        table.grid { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
        table.grid td { border: 1px solid #d5d8dc; padding: 5px 9px; vertical-align: top; }
        table.grid td.lbl { background-color: #f7f8f9; color: #374151; font-weight: bold; width: 20%; }
        table.grid td.val { width: 30%; }
        table.grid td.span { width: 70%; }

        table.amounts { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
        table.amounts th {
            background-color: #f3f4f6; border: 1px solid #000000; padding: 7px 9px;
            font-size: 9.5px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.6px; text-align: left;
        }
        table.amounts th.amt { text-align: right; width: 26%; }
        table.amounts td { border: 1px solid #d5d8dc; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; padding: 5px 9px; }
        table.amounts td.amt { text-align: right; width: 26%; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; font-weight: bold; }
        table.amounts tr.grp td {
            background-color: #fafafa; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.7px; font-size: 9px; color: #374151; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000;
        }
        table.amounts tr.sub td { background-color: #f7f8f9; font-weight: bold; border-top: 1px solid #9aa0a6; }
        table.amounts tr.net td {
            background-color: #fff3ea; border-top: 2px solid #f27022; border-bottom: 2px solid #f27022;
            font-weight: bold; font-size: 11.5px;
        }
        table.amounts tr.net td.amt { font-size: 12.5px; }
        table.amounts tr.words td { font-size: 9.5px; font-style: italic; color: #4b5563; background-color: #fffaf6; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; }

        table.split { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
        table.split td { width: 50%; vertical-align: top; border: none; padding: 0; }
        table.split td.left { padding-right: 6px; }
        table.split td.right { padding-left: 6px; }
        .panel { border: 1px solid #d5d8dc; padding: 9px 11px; }
        .panel-title {
            font-size: 9.5px; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.9px;
            color: #f27022; border-bottom: 1.5px solid #f27022; padding-bottom: 4px; margin-bottom: 6px;
        }
        .panel table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
        .panel table td { padding: 4px 0; font-size: 9.5px; vertical-align: top; }
        .panel table td.k { color: #555555; width: 44%; }
        .panel table td.v { font-weight: bold; color: #111111; }
        .yes { color: #047857; font-weight: bold; }
        .no { color: #b91c1c; font-weight: bold; }

        .closing { break-inside: avoid; }
        .decl {
            border: 1px solid #d5d8dc; background-color: #fafafa; padding: 9px 12px;
            font-size: 9px; color: #4b5563; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 16px; break-inside: avoid;
        }
        .decl-title {
            font-size: 9.5px; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.9px;
            color: #f27022; margin-bottom: 4px;
        }
        table.sign { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 22px; break-inside: avoid; }
        table.sign td { width: 100%; vertical-align: bottom; padding: 0; text-align: right; }
        .sig-company { font-size: 10px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 3px; }
        .sig-space { height: 50px; }
        .sig-img { height: 48px; width: auto; }
        .sig-script { font-family: 'Brush Script MT', 'Segoe Script', cursive; font-size: 22px; color: #1d4ed8; }
        .sig-line { border-top: 1px solid #111111; margin-top: 4px; }
        .sig-title { font-size: 9.5px; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 4px; }
        .sig-sub { font-size: 9px; color: #555555; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <htmlpagefooter name="fnfFooter">
        <div style="border-top:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding-top:5px;text-align:center;font-size:7.5px;color:#475569;">
            <strong>Viral Ads Media</strong> | B-27, Budh Vihar Phase 1, New Delhi - 110086 | Tel: +91 93544 91934 | hr@viraladsmedia.com<br>
            This is a computer-generated Full &amp; Final Settlement Statement. &nbsp;Page {PAGENO} of {nbpg}
        </div>
    </htmlpagefooter>
    <sethtmlpagefooter name="fnfFooter" page="ALL" />

    <table class="header-table">
        <tr>
            <td style="width:50%;vertical-align:middle;">
                <% if (logo) { %>
                    <img src="<%= logo %>" alt="Viral Ads Media" class="logo">
                <% } else { %>
                    <div class="logo-fallback">VIRAL ADS MEDIA</div>
                <% } %>
            </td>
            <td class="header-right">
                <div class="company-name">VIRAL ADS MEDIA</div>
                <div>B-27, Budh Vihar Phase 1, New Delhi - 110086</div>
                <div class="meta"><strong>Ref No:</strong> <%= refNo %></div>
                <div class="meta"><strong>Date of Issue:</strong> <%= issueDate %></div>
                <div class="meta"><strong>Status:</strong> <span class="<%= statusClass %>"><%= status %></span></div>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <div class="title-block">
        <h1>Full &amp; Final Settlement</h1>
        <div class="sub">
            Employment account statement for <strong><%= employeeName %></strong> &nbsp;(<%= employeeId %>, <%= designation %>)
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section-title">Employee &amp; employment details</div>
    <table class="grid">
        <tr>
            <td class="lbl">Employee Name</td><td class="val"><strong><%= employeeName %></strong></td>
            <td class="lbl">Employee ID</td><td class="val"><strong><%= employeeId %></strong></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td class="lbl">Designation</td><td class="val"><%= designation %></td>
            <td class="lbl">Contact Number</td><td class="val"><%= phone %></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td class="lbl">Date of Joining</td><td class="val"><%= dateOfJoining %></td>
            <td class="lbl">Last Working Day</td><td class="val"><strong><%= lastWorkingDay %></strong></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td class="lbl">Total Service</td><td class="val"><%= tenure %></td>
            <td class="lbl">Official Email</td><td class="val"><%= email %></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td class="lbl">Registered Address</td><td class="val span" colspan="3"><%= address %></td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <div class="section-title">Settlement breakup</div>
    <table class="amounts">
        <thead>
            <tr><th>Particulars</th><th class="amt">Amount (Rs.)</th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr class="grp"><td colspan="2">Amounts payable to employee</td></tr>
            <% for (let i = 0; i < payableRows.length; i++) { %>
            <tr><td><%= payableRows[i].label %></td><td class="amt"><%= payableRows[i].amount %></td></tr>
            <% } %>
            <tr class="sub"><td>Total payable</td><td class="amt"><%= subTotalPayable %></td></tr>
            <tr class="grp"><td colspan="2">Deductions &amp; recoveries</td></tr>
            <% for (let i = 0; i < deductionRows.length; i++) { %>
            <tr><td><%= deductionRows[i].label %></td><td class="amt"><%= deductionRows[i].amount %></td></tr>
            <% } %>
            <tr class="sub"><td>Total deductions</td><td class="amt"><%= subTotalDeductions %></td></tr>
            <tr class="net"><td><%= netLabel %></td><td class="amt"><%= netAmount %></td></tr>
            <tr class="words"><td colspan="2">Rupees <%= netWords %> only</td></tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <table class="split">
        <tr>
            <td class="left">
                <div class="panel">
                    <div class="panel-title">Final payout details</div>
                    <table>
                        <tr><td class="k">Bank account</td><td class="v"><%= bankAccount %></td></tr>
                        <tr><td class="k">IFSC code</td><td class="v"><%= ifsc %></td></tr>
                        <tr><td class="k">Payment mode</td><td class="v">NEFT / RTGS to registered account</td></tr>
                        <tr><td class="k">Payment reference</td><td class="v"><%= paymentReference %></td></tr>
                        <tr><td class="k">Disbursed on</td><td class="v"><%= disbursedOn %></td></tr>
                    </table>
                </div>
            </td>
            <td class="right">
                <div class="panel">
                    <div class="panel-title">No-dues &amp; asset clearance</div>
                    <table>
                        <% for (const item of clearance) { %>
                        <tr><td class="k"><%= item.label %></td><td class="v <%= item.css %>"><%= item.value %></td></tr>
                        <% } %>
                        <% if (remarks) { %>
                        <tr><td class="k">Remarks</td><td class="v"><%= remarks %></td></tr>
                        <% } %>
                    </table>
                </div>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <div class="closing">
    <div class="decl">
        <div class="decl-title">Declaration</div>
        This statement sets out all amounts payable to and recoverable from the employee towards the full and final
        settlement of their employment with Viral Ads Media. A negative net figure represents a recovery due to the
        company. Subject to verification, the approved amount will be credited to the registered bank account above;
        payroll intimates the credit date separately. Once approved and disbursed, this statement constitutes the
        complete and final settlement of all employment dues, and any claim raised after disbursement will be adjusted
        against this settlement.
    </div>

    <table class="sign">
        <tr>
            <td class="right">
                <div class="sig-company">For Viral Ads Media</div>
                <div class="sig-space">
                    <% if (hrSignature) { %>
                        <img src="<%= hrSignature %>" alt="HR Signature" class="sig-img">
                    <% } else { %>
                        <span class="sig-script">HR Signature</span>
                    <% } %>
                </div>
                <div class="sig-line"></div>
                <div class="sig-title">Authorised Signatory</div>
                <div class="sig-sub">HR &amp; Accounts Department</div>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
